# Y-Combinator Co-Founder Tool

RAG-powered startup advisor that validates ideas against a chunked Y Combinator
knowledge base. Uses ChromaDB + sentence-transformers for retrieval and Kimi K2
for grounded responses — not hallucinated startup advice.

RAG pipeline indexes ~500 YC essays and startup postmortems into ChromaDB for grounded retrieval.
